      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# 🗣️ LLM\n## Large Language Model\n\nReads text as tokens and predicts likely continuations.\n\n**Best known for:** chat, writing, summarization, coding, and text reasoning.\n\n**Core emphasis:** broad language capability at large scale.",
