        "markdown": "# 📱 SLM\n## Small Language Model\n\nUses the language-model idea at a smaller scale, often optimized for phones, laptops, embedded devices, or private local use.\n\n**Core emphasis:** speed, efficiency, low latency, and smaller hardware footprints.",
